      "text": "real-time Waitlist extension",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "real-time Waitlist extension",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "iV-vxDivgKLsd7j8lLJ4y",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 620.4236539738035,
      "y": 1288.981626220704,
      "width": 513.219482421875,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 702755956,
      "version": 738,
      "versionNonce": 1376995828,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786021616283,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- users will be able to queue to a waitlist for a desk",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- users will be able to queue to a waitlist for a desk",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2w124YPm72fRvSgavzyny",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 618.9272636241399,
      "y": 1329.639591225991,
      "width": 623.6988947644536,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 180163188,
      "version": 1079,
      "versionNonce": 41806708,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786021616283,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- when a desk is freed triggered by the cron job watching for\nexpired bookings, it publishes an event to a message broker",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- when a desk is freed triggered by the cron job watching for expired bookings, it publishes an event to a message broker",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VdSft3c6YYDO8C1GDrMwx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 616.5016296693261,
      "y": 1401.937802586697,
      "width": 623.6988947644536,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 80404044,
      "version": 1491,
      "versionNonce": 2116231156,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786023384977,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " - waitlist service promotes the next person in the list: the\nentry is marked promoted, not deleted, and stays that way\nuntil the booking service confirms.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": " - waitlist service promotes the next person in the list: the entry is marked promoted, not deleted, and stays that way until the booking service confirms.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ScR-t2AouK8WdtEv3u32p",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 618.4039734193261,
      "y": 1494.734677586697,
      "width": 623.6988947644536,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2KV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2093295180,
      "version": 1570,
      "versionNonce": 679869388,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786023393918,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- it publishes waitlist.promoted; the booking service consumes\nit and creates the booking.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- it publishes waitlist.promoted; the booking service consumes it and creates the booking.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
